            "engine_failure",
            "invalid_upload"
          ],
          "description": "invalid_upload is returned with 422 by POST /api/ingest for anything wrong with an uploaded archive - unreadable zip, a member escaping the extraction directory, an oversized archive, or no recognisable collection CSVs. It always names the file. A bad upload is never a 500."
        },
